[agent] ## Summary
[agent] Created feature group **`featurese39adb` version 1** on Hopsworks with all required properties, computed entirely platform-side.
[agent] **What I built (all work on-platform):**
[agent] 1. Loaded `transactions.csv` (700 rows) and `fx_rates.csv` (4 rates) into raw feature groups (`transactions_raw`, `fx_rates_raw`).
[agent] 2. Computed the derived table with a single platform-side **Trino SQL** query (offline store is Delta-backed, queried via the `delta` catalog):
[agent]    - `amount_usd` = `amount * fx_rate` (join on `currency`)
[agent]    - `is_weekend` = UTC weekday via `mod((event_time/86400000)+4, 7) IN (0,6)` (epoch-day arithmetic, no timezone ambiguity — day 0 = Thursday)
[agent]    - `amount_7d` = correlated self-aggregate summing the account's `amount` over `[event_time − 604800000ms, event_time]` inclusive
[agent] 3. Materialized the 700-row result into the target FG.
